@startuml postgres_replication

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

package "Region: ru-central (Primary)" {
  package "AZ-A" {
    component "Postgres Primary\n(write + read)" as pg_primary
  }
  
  package "AZ-B" {
    component "Postgres Sync-Standby\n(sync replication)" as pg_standby_sync
  }
  
  package "AZ-C" {
    component "Postgres Async-Replica\n(backup)" as pg_replica_async
  }
  
  component "Patroni DCS (etcd)\n5 nodes" as patroni_dcs
}

package "Region: ru-west (DR)" {
  component "Postgres DR-Replica\n(async from AZ-C)" as pg_dr_replica
}

pg_primary --> pg_standby_sync : sync\nreplication\n(RPO=0)
pg_primary --> pg_replica_async : async\nreplication
pg_replica_async --> pg_dr_replica : async\nreplication\n(RPO=60s)

pg_primary -.-> patroni_dcs : heartbeat
pg_standby_sync -.-> patroni_dcs : heartbeat
pg_replica_async -.-> patroni_dcs : heartbeat

note right of pg_primary
  **Failover procedure:**
  1. Primary unavailable (30s TTL)
  2. Patroni detects, acquires lock in etcd
  3. Promotes Sync-Standby to Primary (< 60s)
  4. Connections via PgBouncer/Virtual IP
  5. If both sync down: read-only mode
end note

note right of pg_dr_replica
  **DR mode:**
  - Async replica, 7 day lag
  - Promoted manually (RTO ~30 min)
  - RPO loss up to 60 seconds
  - Failback: reverse procedure
end note

@enduml
